New: share your time. Send someone a code and your clock joins their world clock list and home-screen widget. Only the time is shared, never where you are: by default just how far your clock is from theirs, or your timezone or ship if you choose. Tap their row and their part of the world lights up. Link your tablet, or a browser at geotime.app, to see your people there too. Either of you can stop at any time, or delete everything at once. Follow up to five people, free.
